 "build": {
  "id": "2801aecd-4739-41d8-be70-7577105bebc4",
  "title": "Mech Tinker ST/AoE dungeons and raid",
  "description": "[overview]\nI experimented alot and this build i came to is very versatile and deals good ST and AoE dps.\n\ni will maybe write more later when i have more time.\n\n[talents]\nOpen to suggestions but i feel like this talent build is the sweet spot\n\n[rotation]\nprio gear grind on ST\nuse sticky bomb right after laser beam (ST) or Combustion (AoE) you can throw it in the gcd window\nScrap shot / Gatling gut on ST\n\nAoE use Airstrike on cd, and cycle Combustion and Makeshift Dynamite, throwing the Sticky bomb in Gcd window\n\n[stats]\nAttack Power Scales pretty much everything so prio that.\nagi a bit better then int.\n1 int = 1 AP (talents)\n\n[pvp]\nNot A PvP player",
  "class_id": 28,
  "spec_id": 75,
